---
layout: layouts/base.vto
title: Journal
description: Notes from On Words about clear, confident English.
url: /blog/
---
<p class="page-label">Journal</p>
<h1 class="page-title">Notes on words, and on getting them right.</h1>
<p class="page-standfirst">Occasional writing about editing, language learning, and the small decisions that make a sentence work.</p>

<div class="journal-list">
  {{ if search.pages("type=post").length }}
  {{ for post of search.pages("type=post", "date=desc") }}
  <article class="journal-entry">
    <p class="rail-label"><time datetime="{{ post.date.toISOString() }}">{{ post.date.toLocaleDateString('en-CH', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' }) }}</time></p>
    <div class="journal-entry-body">
      <h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.title }}</a></h2>
      <p>{{ post.description }}</p>
    </div>
  </article>
  {{ /for }}
  {{ else }}
  <p class="empty-state">The journal is taking shape. Please check back soon.</p>
  {{ /if }}
</div>
